    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just stress though. it's real. i'm seeing the gaps getting wider. it feels like i'm watching a movie of my life but the film is melting. i'm terrified of the person i'll become... someone who can't even hold a conversation or recognize their own kids. i'd rather just leave before i become a ghost in my own body. does that make any sense?",
